<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Filphisiyuusa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filphisiyuusa Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc3">Filphi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filphisiyuusa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosi Filphisiyuusa Asaas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafida Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi Filphisiyuusa asaas xaafida kiitay xaafetiday, Roome kawotethan, Maqedoone biittan, Filphisiyuusa kataman de7iya woosa keethasa. Ha kiitay xaafetiday, Phawuloosi qasho keethan de7iya wode hara ammaniya oosanchoti iya ixida wodenne Filphisiyuusa woosa keethan dendida wordo timirtiya gaason iya wozanay daro azzanida wode (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:21">1:21</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:17">2:17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:10">3:10</ref></char>). Gidoshin, Phawuloosi Yesuus Kiristoosa minthidi ammaniya gisho ha kiitan qoncidi bentey, ufaysinne kumetha ammanetethi. Filphisiyuusan de7iya daro asay Roomepe di7etidi yida asi. Enti Roome biittas mishetoosonanne biitta loythidi naagoosona. Entafe issoti issoti Yesuusa ammanida gisho, banta biitta asan goodetidosona. He gooday enta bolla metonne manqotethi ehis (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:20-21">Hawa 16:20-21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi ha kiita xaafida gaasoy iya metuwa wode iya maaddanaw ammaniya asay imota iyaw yeddida gishonne iyaw woossida gisho, enta galatanaasa. Iya bollanne enta bolla dumma dumma metoy gakidaba gidikoka enti minetana melanne kumethi ammanetidi daana mela enta minthethees. Ceeqonne otoro aggidi, Yesuus Kiristoosa ashketethan kumana mela minthidi enta akeekisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Enti Yesuus Kiristoosan gididi demmida de7oy Xoossa aadho keehatethaafe pultidabanne ammanon ekidabape attishin Ayhudeta woga naagidi ekidaba gidonaysa enta akeekisees. Yesuus Kiristoosan de7iya ubbaas Xoossay immiya saruwanne ufaysa entaw xaafees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiitay ufaysi, ammanetethi, issifetethinne ammanon minnidi duussu qoncisidi bessees. Wursethan Phawuloosi Xoossa ammaniya asay siiqon daana melanne Kiristoosa qofatho daana mela enta zorees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:2">2:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:2-3">4:2-3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosi hanidi de7iya de7uwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:12-30">1:12-30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ashketetha duussa leemiso <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 2:1-18">2:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ximotiyoosasinne Ephafraditusa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Morketapenne iitatape naagetethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1—4:9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosi Filphisiyuusa asaa galatees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4:10-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sarothonne anjo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4:21-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Kiristoos Yesuusara issifida gisho, Xoossaba gidida, Filphisiyuusa kataman de7iya woosa keethaa cimatasinne daaqoneta ubbaas. Yesuus Kiristoosa aylle gidida, Phawuloosapenne Ximotiyoosape kiitetida kiitaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:12">Hawa 16:12</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Nu Aawa Xoossaafenne Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosape aadho keehatethaynne sarotethay hintew gido.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Galata Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Taani hintena qopiya wode ubban, ta Xoossaa galatayis. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Taani hinte ubbaas Xoossaa woossiya wode ufaysan woossayis. <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>Hinte koyro gallasape ha77i gakanaw, Wongela markateysan taara issife gididi, tana maaddida gisho, Xoossaa galatayis. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Hinte giddon lo77o ooso doomida Xoossay, Kiristoos Yesuusi simmiya gallasay gakanaw, polanaysa erayis.<verse eid="PHP 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Hinte ubba wode ta wozanan de7eeta. Taani ubba wodeka hessada qopanaw bessees. Ha77i taani qashon de7ashenne qashetanaape sinthe Wongela naagoninne Wongela mintha eson Xoossay taw qaadida qaada hinteka taara shaaketideta. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Taani hintena ubbaa Kiristoos Yesuusa siiquwan ay mela laamotiyako Xoossay taw marka.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Hinte siiqoy tuma eratetharanne akeekara issife guji guji diccana mela Xoossaa woossayis. <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>Hessan hinte lo77oba shaakidi, dooreyisata, Kiristoosi simmiya gallasan geeshshatanne boretonayisata gidana. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Hinte de7oy Xoossaa bonchuwasinne galatas Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara bentiya xillotethaa ayfiyan kumidi ayfana.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Qashoy Wongela Dalgisis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Ta ishato, tana gakida ubbay Wongelay dalgana mela tuma maaddidaysa hinte erana mela koyayis. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Taani Kiristoosa gisho qashetidaysa, kawo gadho naageysatinne haysan de7iya harati ubbay eroosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Hawa 28:30</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Ta qashuwa gaason nu ishatape daroti Godan keehi ammanetidosona. Hessa gisho, Xoossaa qaala yashshi bayna kasepe minnidi odana mela minotethi demmidosona.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Gidoshin, issoti issoti qanaateninne palaman Kiristoosaba odoosona, shin harati suure wozanape odoosona. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Suure wozanape odeysati, Xoossay taw Wongela naagana mela hadara immidaysa eriya gisho, siiqon odoosona. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Shin tana qanaateysati ta qashuwa bolla hara meto ehanaba entaw daanin bantana dosidi Kiristoosaba odoosonape attishin, tuma wozanape odokona.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Hessi aykoka metenna. Tuma ogen gidin woyko wordo ogen gidin he ubban Kiristoosi sabbaketees. Tana hessi ufaysees. Qassi harabay tana ufaysiyabay, <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>taani hinte woosaninne Yesuus Kiristoosa Ayyaana maaduwan attanaysa eriya gisho tana ufaysees. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Ta gita amoynne ufaysan naagiya naagoy ta yeellatonna attanaysa. Shin ubba wode ootheysada, ha77ika taani paxa de7in woyko hayqin yayyonna ta kumetha asatethan Kiristoosi bonchetana gada minotethan odayis. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Ta de7ikoka Kiristoosa xalaalas de7ayis; qassi ta hayqikoka taw aadhida wodhe. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Shin ta paxa de7iko ayfey de7iya ooso oothana. Shin paxa de7eysafenne hayqope awusa dooraneko taw eretenna. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Taani ha nam7atape awusa dooraneko un7etas. Ha de7uwape shaaketada Kiristoosara issife daanaw amottayis; Kiristoosara issife de7eysi ubbaafe aadhida lo77o. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Shin taani hinte gisho paxa de7eysi hintew daro koshshiyaba.<verse eid="PHP 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Hessa taani geeshshada erayis; taani, hinte ammanon diccanaadanne ufaytanaada hintera paxa daana. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Hessa gisho, taani hinteko simmada yaa wode, Kiristoos Yesuusara hinte de7iya de7uwan tanan de7iya ceeqetethay hintew darana.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Ubbaafe aathidi, hinte Kiristoosa Wongelas boncho ehiya de7o de7ite. Ta hintena be7in woyko be7onna ixin, hinte issi qofan minni eqidi, harati Wongelan ammanana mela issi wozanan gididi issife baaxeteysa ta si7ana. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Hinte morketas yayyofite. Enti hintera eqetiyaba gidiko hessi hintew atotethas, entaw dhayos Xoossaafe gidida malla. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Kiristoosas oothiya qaaday hintew imetiday, hinte iya ammanana mela xalaala gidonashin hinte iya gisho meto ekana melasa. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Hessa gisho, hinte ta waayiya kase be7ideta; ha77ika ta waayeteysa si7eeta. Hinteka ta waayiya mela waayeteta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Hawa 16:19-40</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Ashketethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Kiristoosan hinte de7iya de7oy hintena minthees; qassi iya siiqoyka hintena minthethees. Geeshsha Ayyaanara hintew issifetethi de7ees; hinte haratas keehetanne qadheteta. <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Hiza, hinte issi qofan, siiqon, issi wozananinne ayyaanan issino gididi tana polo ufaysite. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Hintena doson woyko ceeqetiya hada amon issibaaka oothopite. Shin hinte issoy issuwafe gitatayis yaagidi qoponna hintena kawushite. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Hinte issoy issoy, hara asi maaddiyaba koyitepe attishin, hintena maaddiyaba xalaala koyopite.<verse eid="PHP 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Kiristoos Yesuusan de7iya qofay hintenan daanaw bessees.<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Iyaw ubba wode Xoossa hanoti de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">Gidoshin, iya Xoossara issino oothiya hanota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">wolqan ekanaw koybeenna.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Gidoshin, I baw de7iya bonchuwa ubbaa aggidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">aylle medheta ekis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">ase daanidi qoncis.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>I bana kawushis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">hayqana gakanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">hari attoshin masqaliya bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">hayqanaw kiitetis.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Hessa gisho, Xoossay iya daro dhoqu dhoqu oothis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">qassi suntha ubbaafeka aadhiya dhoqa sunthaa immis.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Saloninne sa7an,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">sa7ape garsan de7iya ubbay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">Yesuusa sunthaa bonchuwas gulbatana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>Asa ubbay banta inxarsan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">Yesuus Kiristoosa Godaa yaagidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">Xoossaa Aawa bonchuwas markatana.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Alames Poo7o Gido</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Ta ishato, taani hintera de7iya wode ubban hinte kiitetidaysada, ha77i taani hinte matape haakinka, kaseysafe aathidi, kiitetanaw bessees. Xoossaas yashshaninne kokorsan hinte atotetha polanaw oothite. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Xoossay, hinte iyaw ero gidi kiitetana mela ubba wode hinte giddon oothees.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Ay ooso oothisheka zuuzumonna woyko palamonna oothite. <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>Geellanne nagarancho asaa giddon boretonayisata, geeshshatanne pokoy bayna Xoossaa naytada gidite. Hinte enta giddon salo xoolintoda poo7ishe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Zaare 32:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>de7o immiya kiitaa entaw odite. He wode ta daabursaynne ta oosoy mela attiboona gisho, Kiristoosi yaa gallas ta hintenan ceeqetana.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Hinte Xoossaas immiya ammano imota bolla ta suuthay ushsha yarshoda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ta suuthay ushsha yarshoda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi wode yarsho bessan yarshetiya mehe yarshuwa bolla haathe woyko woyne ushshay gukees.</char></note> gukikoka tana ufaysees. Hinteka taara ufaytana. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Hessada hinteka ufaytidi tanaka ufaysanaw bessees.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximotiyoosanne Ephafiraditusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Taani hinte de7uwabaa si7ada ufaytanaw Ximotiyoosa hinteko ellesada yeddana mela Godaa Yesuusi tana maaddanaysa ammanetayis. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Hinte de7uwas wozanape qopiya iya mela asi hari oonika baawa. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Harati bantana go77iyabaa koyoosonape attishin, Yesuus Kiristoosi koyaba oothokona. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>I taara issife gididi na7i ba aawas ootheysada Wongela ooso oothidaysanne ammanetiya asi gideysa hinte ereeta. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Hessa gisho, tabay haniyaba be7ada ellesada iya hinteko yeddana gada qopayis. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Taani, ta huuphen mata woden hinteko baanaysa Godan ammanetayis.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Hessadaka, taani, ta ishaa Ephafiraditusa, taara issife ta bagga gididi oothidaysa, oletidaysanne, tana maaddanaw hintew kiitetidaysa, hinteko kiittanaw qopas. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>I hintena ubbaa be7anaw daro laamotees. Qassi I hargetidaysa hinte si7ida gisho, ba wozanan daro un7etis. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>I tuma hargetidi, hayqi kichidi attis. Shin Xoossay iyaw qadhetis. Iya xalaalas gidonashin, azzanoy azzano bolla guzhetonnaada tawuka qadhetis.<verse eid="PHP 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Hiza, hinte iya zaari be7idi ufaytanaada tawuka ta wozanaa seelay irxanaada taani iya ellesada hinteko yeddanaw amottayis. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Godaas haggaaziya asada iya kumetha ufaysan mokite. Qassi iya mela asa ubbaa bonchite. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Hinte ta matan gididi oothanaw danda7onna maaddiya maaddidi Kiristoosa oosuwa gisho, ba shempuwas mishetonna ixidi hayqi kichidi attis.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Tuma Xillotethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Wursethan, ta ishato, hinte Godaaba gidiya gisho, ufaytite. Taani kase xaafidaysa zaarada xaafanaysi tana waaysenna, shin hintena balape naagana.<verse eid="PHP 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Iitabaa oothiya kanatape, qassi qaxaretanaw koshshees giya iita asatape naagetite. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Nuuni Xoossaa Geeshsha Ayyaanan goyinniya gishonne nu de7uwan Kiristoos Yesuusan ceeqetiya gisho, tuma qaxaro qaxaretidaysata. Nuuni kare asatethaa bolla oosetiyaban ceeqetoko.<verse eid="PHP 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Ta kare asatethan ceeqetanaw koshshiko ta daroban ceeqetanaw danda7ayis. Ay asika ba kare asatethan ceeqetiyabay baw de7ees gidi qopiko, taani iyape daro aadhada ceeqetiyabay de7ees. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Taani yeletida saamintara qaxaretas. Taani yeletan Isra7eele; taani Biniyaame koche; taani walaki bayna Ayhude ase. Ayhude higge naagon gidiko taani Farsaawe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Hawa 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26:5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:1">Roome 11:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Ayhude ammanuwas mishetethan gidiko taani woosa keethaa yedethas. Issi asi higge naagidi xilliyaba gidiko, tanan borey bentibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Hawa 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="PHP 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Shin kase tana maaddees gada qopidaba ubbaa, Kiristoosa gisho gada maaddonnaba oothada taybas. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Hessa xalaala gidonashin, taani ta Godaa Kiristoos Yesuusa ereysi haraba ubbaafe daro aadhiya gisho, he ubbaa wodhey baynabaada taybas. Taani iya gisho ubbaba dhayas. Kiristoosa demmanaw ubbaba wora holetida buureda taybayis. Taani Yesuusara issino gidas. <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>Taani higges kiitetada demmiya ta huuphe xillotethi taw baawa. Kiristoosa ammanin bentiya xillotethay, Xoossaa matape yaa xillotethay ha77i taw de7ees. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Taani Kiristoosanne iya dendo wolqaa eranaw koyayis. Taani iya metuwa iyara shaaketanawunne iya hayquwan iya daananaw amottayis. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Hessadaka, hayqope dendada merinaw de7on daanaysa ufaysi oothayis.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gaxa Gakanaw Woxite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Taani ha77i gaxa gakas woyko tanan bali baawa giike. Shin Kiristoos Yesuusi tana oykida gisho taani ta sinthan de7iya woytuwa oykanaw woxaysinne butetayis. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Ta ishato, taani hessa demmas gada qopike, shin taani issiba oothayis. Taape guyera de7eysa dogada sinthan de7eysa oykanaw zaaturayis. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Hessa gisho, taani gaxa gakanaw woxayis. Xoossay Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara salo de7uwas xeegida woytuwa ekanaw daaburayis.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Hiza, nuuni Ayyaanan gashtida ubbay hessa qopanaw bessees. Hintefe baggatas dummatiya qofi de7iko, hessaka Xoossay hintew qoncisana. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Gidikoka, nuuni hanno gakanaw de7ida de7uwan, ane sinthe boos.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Ta ishato, tana daanite; hessadaka, nu leemisuwa kaalliya asata akeekidi be7ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:16">2 Qoro 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:1">11:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Taani hessa hintew kase daro toho odas, shin ha77ika zaarada afuthan odayis. Kiristoosa masqaliyas bantana morke oothida daro asati de7oosona. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Enta wursethay dhayo; enta uloy entaw xoosse. Yeellatanaw bessiyaban enti ceeqetoosona; qassi ha sa7aba xalaala qopoosona. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Nu biittay saluwana. Salope yidi nuna ashshiya Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa naagoos. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Kiristoosi ubbaba ba maatape garsan oothanaw danda7iya ba wolqan nu daaburancho asatethaa laammidi ba boncho asatethaa daanisana.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Wursetha Zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Ta ishato, ta doseysato, ta laamoteysato, tana ufayseysato, tana gitayeysato, hiza, Godan minnidi eqite.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Ewoodanne Sinxika, hinte nam7ay, issi qofan, michida Godan daanada taani hintena zorayis. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Taara oothiya ammantheyso, neeni ha maccasata maaddana mela ta nena woossayis. Ha maccasati taara, Qeleminxoosaranne enta sunthay Xoossaa de7o maxaafan xaafetida haratara issife wongela ubba bessaa gathanaw daaburidosona.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Godaara hinte de7iya de7uwan ubba wode ufaytite. Taani hessa gujadaka odayis; ufaytite.<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Asi ubbay hinte ashketetha ero; Goday matan yaana. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Hinte Xoossaa woossiya wode ubban iya galatishe, hintena koshshiyaba ubbaas woossitepe attishin, aybibaasika hirgofite. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Asa eratetha ubbaafe aadhiya Xoossaa sarotethay, hinte wozanaanne hinte qofaa Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa baggara naagana.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Wursethan, ta ishato, hinte wozanan lo77obaanne galatisiyaba qopite. Tuma gidiyaba ubbaa, bonchoba ubbaa, qoho gidonnaba ubbaa, geeshshaba ubbaa, siiqoba ubbaanne ufaysiyaba ubbaa qopite. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Hinte taape tamaaridaba, ekidaba, si7idabanne be7idaba ubbaa oothite. Sarotethi immiya Xoossay hintera issife gidana.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Shiiqida Imotas Galatis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Daro wodepe guye, hinte tabaa zaaridi qopanaw doomida gisho taani Godan daro ufaytayis. Hessa guussay, taw qopanaw hintew injetonna ixidaysafe attishin, taw qofaa aggibeketa. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Taani hessa tana metida gisho giike; taw de7iyabay gidana guussu tamaaras. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Taani metootetidi de7iya duussi erayis; qassi duretidi de7iya duussika erayis. Awun gidin qassi ay wodeka taani kalonne kosha, pacenne palaha tamaaras. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Kiristoosi taw immiya wolqan ubbaba oothanaw danda7ayis.<verse eid="PHP 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Gidikoka, hinte ta metuwa taara ekidaysan lo77o oothideta. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Filphisiyuusa asato, Wongela koyro odanaw taani Maqedoonepe keyiya wode immiyabanka ekiyabanka hinte woosa keethaafe attishin, hari tana maaddiboonaysa hinte ereeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Qoro 11:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>Teselonqen metoy gakida wodeka tana zaari zaaridi maaddideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Hawa 17:1</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Taani, hintefe imota ekanaw koyada gidonashin, imope yaa anjuwa hinte ekana melasa.<verse eid="PHP 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Taani, hinte immida ubbaanne gididi palaheysa ekas. Hinte yeddida ubbaa Ephafiraditusape ekas; koshshiyaba ubbay taw de7ees. Hinte taw yeddida imoy Xoossaas sawo tonku giya, I dosiya, I ufaytiya yarsho mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Kessa 29:18</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Ta Xoossay ba boncho duretethaafe, Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara hintew koshshiyaba ubbaa immana. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Nu Aawa Xoossaas merinaape merinaa gakanaw bonchoy gido. Amin7i.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Kiristoos Yesuusa baggara Xoossaba gidida ubbaa saro giite. Taara de7iya ishati hintena saro goosona. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Xoossaba gidida asa ubbay, ubbaafe aathidi Kawa Qeesare keethan de7eysati hintena saro goosona.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Godaa Yesuus Kiristoosa aadho keehatethay hintera gido.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
